            "identifier": "SCENE_WOOD",
            "location_header": "EXT. THE WOOD - EVENING",
            "visual_description": "A sun-dappled clearing in an English wood during a summer evening. Tall green bracken and ferns frame the foreground from a low, ground-level perspective (rabbit's eye view). Golden hour light filters through tree branches, creating soft dappled shadows on mossy ground. Vibrant greens, warm ambers, and earthy browns."
